{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>葉蒨文憑著甜美外樣與姣好身材，一直深受廣大觀眾及網民喜愛。經常在社交平台分享生活點滴的她，近日上載了一組與愛貓的甜蜜親密合照，互動畫面充滿愛意。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_5ab73b76f96d51b4-438\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從相中可見，葉蒨文身穿一襲粉紅色低胸 V 領短袖上衣，在室內與愛貓玩得不亦樂乎。她先是拿著粉紅色的貓玩具逗弄愛貓，隨後更整個人慵懶地趴在地氈上，以高角度俯拍與貓咪合照。不過，不少網民卻瞬間「錯重點」，大讚她的身材實在極佳。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_5ab73b76f96d51b4-438\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e0f53151-2499-4956-a557-34eecdfb5019.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026qJOK02zZzP1789548845.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e0f53151-2499-4956-a557-34eecdfb5019.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4a026413-e4b0-4494-b814-c7997869bf00.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026YMjx2FqIhA1789548845.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4a026413-e4b0-4494-b814-c7997869bf00.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_5ab73b76f96d51b4-439\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>此外，亦有大量網民將注意力集中在她與愛貓的互動上，發現這隻白色的愛貓神情與葉蒨文如出一轍，笑言兩主寵簡直是「複製貼上」。網民紛紛留言笑指：「生咗隻同自己一樣嘅🐱🐱點解可以做到連神情都一模一樣!!!!🤭🤭」。面對網民大讚貓咪與自己十分相似，葉蒨文亦親自親民留言回應：「好搞笑，佢成日啲神態表情好似人😂」，盡展其親民又搞笑的一面。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T09:20:10.899083+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}